<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of  Spanish first division matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Deportivo Coruna 0 Barcelona 1 (Juan Pizzi 87). Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 34,000.</p>
